traints and advisory mapping. The accepted fresh daemon assessment passed without limitations.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §6.1","DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: Root dependency selections and Trial dependency constraints","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[daemon]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["daemon"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"daemon","findingId":"daemon-002"},"rationale":"PDF.js and csv-parse removal candidates, static/dynamic caller checks, packaged entry-point checks and preserved DuckDB CSV coverage are explicit and were accepted in the complete fresh daemon assessment.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §4 ac1 and unit subjects","LLD.md §6.1","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[daemon]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["daemon"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"drivers","findingId":"drivers-001"},"rationale":"Concrete SMTP and driver selections, compatible Cassandra ZIP constraints and saved-configuration qualification are supplied. The accepted fresh driver assessment verified these decisions and passed without limitations.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §4 integration subjects and ac2","LLD.md §6.1","DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: Batch 2 selections and constraints","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[drivers]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["drivers"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"drivers","findingId":"drivers-002"},"rationale":"The regression now specifies overwrite and permission preservation, separate outside sentinels, vulnerable-baseline detection, and unchanged bytes/mode across all three extraction APIs. The complete fresh driver assessment accepted the revised specification.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §3 ZIP error case","DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: ZIP symlink regression probe","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[drivers]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["drivers"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"native","findingId":"native-001"},"rationale":"The baseline now supplies pinned upstream integrity, manifest-only derivation, retained licensing and bindings, staging ownership and bundled consumer delivery. However, the accepted fresh native assessment is incomplete; resolution is therefore not asserted.","evidenceReferences":["DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: Standalone package delivery","LLD.md §6.1","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[native].limitations"],"action":"carry"},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"native","findingId":"native-002"},"rationale":"Migration now constrains rollback to verified backup restoration and defines populated pre-upgrade records, vectors, queue and receipts. The fresh native assessment remains incomplete, so the origin remains carried despite the responsive correction.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §5 migration steps 5–6 and Backward compat","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[native].limitations"],"action":"carry"},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"consistency","findingId":"consistency-001"},"rationale":"The current LLD defines the three batch boundaries, acceptance meanings and final combined sweep. Final consistency still has an unresolved mandatory inventory verification gap, so this origin is preserved rather than resolved through an incomplete assessment.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §4 Acceptance mapping","LLD.md §5 migration steps 1–4","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[native].limitations"],"action":"carry"}],"effectiveFindingOrigins":[{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"native","findingId":"native-001"},{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"native","findingId":"native-002"},{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"consistency","findingId":"consistency-001"}]}},"finishedAt":"2026-11-08T17:20:22.295Z"}],"applicableAttempt":2,"status":"incomplete","binding":{"sourceRevision":{"number":2,"contentHash":"7268dd3962f60f3c40e7355e12f6cd6d97ac7587295bc6bad5cdd28b1675131c"},"reviewedContentIdentity":"f6bc6acab400b25d99c56f7b322d0d02d203cc06abf02c317a33c03f469b8f2b","documentDigest":"a653550fce14908b48431a0d0b58f761ffac3ba676fb65880be2545cd8e7864c","workflowDigest":"