raints and advisory mapping. The accepted fresh daemon assessment passed without limitations.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §6.1","DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: Root dependency selections and Trial dependency constraints","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[daemon]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["daemon"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"daemon","findingId":"daemon-002"},"rationale":"PDF.js and csv-parse removal candidates, static/dynamic caller checks, packaged entry-point checks and preserved DuckDB CSV coverage are explicit and were accepted in the complete fresh daemon assessment.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §4 ac1 and unit subjects","LLD.md §6.1","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[daemon]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["daemon"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"drivers","findingId":"drivers-001"},"rationale":"Concrete SMTP and driver selections, compatible Cassandra ZIP constraints and saved-configuration qualification are supplied. The accepted fresh driver assessment verified these decisions and passed without limitations.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §4 integration subjects and ac2","LLD.md §6.1","DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: Batch 2 selections and constraints","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[drivers]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["drivers"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"drivers","findingId":"drivers-002"},"rationale":"The regression now specifies overwrite and permission preservation, separate outside sentinels, vulnerable-baseline detection, and unchanged bytes/mode across all three extraction APIs. The complete fresh driver assessment accepted the revised specification.","evidenceReferences":["LLD.md §3 ZIP error case","DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md: ZIP symlink regression probe","Checkpoint attempt 2 completedChunks[drivers]"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["drivers"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"native","findingId":"native-001"},"rationale":"The baseline now supplies pinned upstream integr