itations/4","/citations/7","/citations/10","/citations/12","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/LLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-46667edffe5cc451-s1.json","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/ISSUE.md","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/DEPENDABOT-SNAPSHOT.json: independently recomputed counts, batch 1 mappings and SHA-256 985cfe3e75aa98047cb27935acfd6a157f9defe46712ab9b501a08532ac9028c","package.json: dependency declarations, build scripts and executable entry points","package-lock.json: resolved batch 1 package paths and parent declarations; only root declarations reference pdfjs-dist and csv-parse","https://docs.npmjs.com/cli/v10/configuring-npm/package-json/#overrides","src/mcp/server.ts:1264","src/bin/insrc-mcp.ts","src/mcp/structural-schema.ts","src/mcp/__tests__/structural-schema.test.ts","src/daemon/tools/builtins/http/index.ts: HTTP redirects, aborts, bounded responses and WebSocket handshake","src/agent/providers/ollama.ts:285-320","src/agent/providers/__tests__/ollama-private-transport.test.ts","src/indexer/target-resolution/config-sources.ts: YAML parsing and malformed-input handling","src/daemon/db/file-execution.ts: native CSV reader and option validation","src/daemon/db/drivers/duckdb-file.ts","src/daemon/db/__tests__/duckdb-file-driver.test.ts","copy-assets.mjs","Repository source, scripts, client and compiled JavaScript searches for pdfjs-dist and csv-parse"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Runtime qualification remains build-stage work: execute the specified MCP, HTTP/TLS, WebSocket, Ollama, YAML and saved CSV checks against the final resolved graph. This review assessed their design and existing coverage without running them.","No batch 1 UX or relationship diagram is necessary: external contracts remain unchanged, and the dependency table and removal conditions adequately describe the proposed dependency changes. No visual rendering verification is claimed."]},{"chunkId":"drivers","status":"passed","summary":"All assigned selectors were assessed. Batch 2 traces the ISSUE’s SMTP, saved-connection and ZIP requirements, preserves daemon ownership and existing driver contracts, and defines suitable compatibility gates. The captured driver advisory ranges exclude the selected versions. The ZIP specification covers exploit preconditions, vulnerable-baseline detection and all three extraction APIs while separating runtime protection from tracker reconciliation. No blocking design defect was demonstrated.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/contractDetails","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/migration","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/citations/2","/citations/8","/citations/9","/citations/10","/citations/11","/citations/12","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/LLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-46667edffe5cc451-s1.json",".insrc/tmp/design-review/dependabot-46667edf-design.json — prior driver feedback and current assignment","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/ISSUE.md","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/DEPENDENCY-BASELINE.md — batch selections, scoped constraints, ZIP probe and release evidence boundary","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/DEPENDABOT-SNAPSHOT.json — verified SHA-256, recomputed severity/manifest counts and all SMTP, ZIP, MySQL, gRPC and MSAL affected-range comparisons","package-lock.json — Nodemailer, Cassandra, adm-zip, MySQL, etcd, gRPC, Tedious, Azure Identity and MSAL versions and parent declarations","src/daemon/tools/builtins/notify/index.ts:390 — SMTP configuration, credential resolution, TLS, recipients, attachments, partial rejection and cleanup","src/daemon/db/config.ts — saved configuration ownership, validation and family inference","src/daemon/db/registry.ts — driver registration and factory selection","src/daemon/db/pool.ts — saved configuration loading, runtime preparation and secret resolution","src/daemon/db/drivers/cassandra.ts — factory, namespace/schema discovery and bounded reads","src/daemon/db/drivers/etcd.ts — host/auth configuration, namespace discovery and reads","src/daemon/db/drivers/mysql.ts — URL conversion, registered factories and read contracts","src/daemon/db/drivers/mssql.ts — SQL authentication, encrypted transport and connection lifecycle","src/daemon/db/file-execution.ts:45 — preserved DuckDB CSV reader","src/daemon/db/__tests__/mysql-integration.test.ts — saved configuration, schema and read coverage","src/daemon/db/__tests__/other-kv-probes.test.ts — Cassandra and etcd disposable-service probes","src/daemon/db/__tests__/remaining-sql-probes.test.ts — SQL Server SDK-boundary probes and failure cleanup","src/daemon/db/__tests__/integration-helpers.ts — explicit unavailable-service skips","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vwc7-r8mq-g2x9","https://github.com/cthackers/adm-zip/releases/tag/v0.6.1","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cthackers/adm-zip/v0.6.1/adm-zip.js — extraction signatures and destination symlink checks","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/apache/cassandra-nodejs-driver/v4.10.0/package.json — adm-zip ~0.6.0 accepts 0.6.1","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-js/@azure/identity_4.14.1/sdk/identity/identity/package.json — MSAL ^7.1.0 and Node 22 compatibility"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Include SMTP authentication failure, required-STARTTLS failure and partial-recipient rejection alongside successful authenticated delivery and attachment checks.","Retain saved-configuration, service-backed read, ZIP and combined-suite execution as build gates. Existing Cassandra/etcd reachability probes and mocked SQL Server probes alone do not establish the planned schema, read and transport compatibility; unavailable coverage must remain explicitly pending.","Runtime qualification was not executed during this read-only design review. The documented ZIP probes are preliminary evidence, not final build verification.","The assigned changes preserve configuration ownership and interaction boundaries and introduce no UX changes requiring additional diagrams. No visual rendering verification is claimed."]},{"chunkId":"native","status":"passed","summary":"All assigned selectors were inspected. The design adequately specifies the pinned, manifest-only bundled SDK, consumer native-binding selection, unchanged memory contracts, qualification gates and backup-based recovery. Independent checks confirmed the upstream archive integrity, snapshot integrity, all 130 alert-table records, recomputed counts and selected-version range exclusions. No blocking design defect was demonstrated.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/body/summary","/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/body/migration","/body/alternativesConsidered","/body/alternativesConsidered/0","/body/alternativesConsidered/1","/body/alternativesConsidered/2","/body/chosenAlternative","/body/openQuestions","/citations/1","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citations/5","/citations/6","/citations/7","/citations/10","/citations/12","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/S001/LLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-46667edffe5cc451-s1.json",".insrc/tmp/design-review/dependabot-46667edf-design.json — current assignment, preceding chunk feedback and carried native findings","docs/standalone/remediate-critical-high-moderate-dependabot-alerts-E2026110846667edf/ISSUE.md","docs/standalone/remedia